OL,3,GNEWSACity backs Para Athletics Worlds
OL,4,Abid despite #6m warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FBirmingham will bid to host the World
OL,7,FPara Athletics Championships in 2029,
OL,8,Fdespite warnings it could cost up to
OL,9,F#6m to stage the event.
OL,11,FThe championships would be held at
OL,12,FAlexander Stadium if the bid is
OL,13,Fsuccessful, with the council describing
OL,14,Fit as an opportunity to build on the
OL,15,Flegacy of the 2022 Commonwealth Games.
OL,17,FParalympic sprinter, Ndidikama Okoh,
OL,18,Fsaid she was "so excited" at the
OL,19,Fprospect of the championships coming to
OL,20,FBirmingham, where she began her journey
OL,21,Fin para athletics.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
