OL,3,GNEWSACity backs Para Athletics Worlds
OL,4,Abid despite #6m warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut government-appointed commissioners
OL,7,Foverseeing the authority's financial
OL,8,Frecovery warned councillors that they
OL,9,Fshould consider not bidding and assess
OL,10,Fwhether the money could be better
OL,11,Fspent.
